### Payment Report - All
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/reports/payment/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Payment Report - Date Range
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/reports/payment/?date_from=2026-01-01&date_to=2026-10-31
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Customer Receipts Only
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/reports/payment/?payment_type=customer_receipt
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Vendor Payments Only
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/reports/payment/?payment_type=vendor_payment
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Filter by Method
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/reports/payment/?payment_method=bank_transfer
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Filter by Status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/reports/payment/?status=pending
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Filter by Bank Account
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/reports/payment/?bank_account=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Monthly Graphs
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/reports/payment/?chart_year=2026&graph_year=2026&graph_month=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Pagination
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/reports/payment/?page=1&page_size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Combined Filters
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/reports/payment/?date_from=2026-01-01&date_to=2026-10-31&payment_type=vendor_payment&payment_method=bank_transfer&status=completed&bank_account=1&chart_year=2026&graph_year=2026&page=1&page_size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
